From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:16:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Settings > Sable holds Sable Setup only

Settings > Sable opened Sable Start, the quick bar editor, Hub, Tools
diagnostics and hardware tests, App display compatibility and Mobile
Manager. Each of those is reachable from its own app, Display, App info
or Apps > Mobile Manager, so the page now holds one row, Sable Setup
(org.sableos.titan2.setup), the readiness checklist for the home screen,
keyboard and default apps. The homepage row and search follow whether
Sable Setup is installed.
